WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.632
Dong Zhuo's great general Lu Bu was unmatched in bravery — no one was his equal.

00:00:04.982 --> 00:00:09.590
He sat on his tall war horse before the pass, his presence astonishing.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:14.068
The three brothers Liu Bei, Guan Yu and Zhang Fei volunteered to go and fight Lu Bu.

00:00:14.418 --> 00:00:17.970
The three exchanged a look and nodded, full of confidence.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.008
The three brothers charged out of the camp gate and ran toward the battlefield.

00:00:21.358 --> 00:00:24.910
The soldiers outside the camp gate waved and cheered them on.

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:28.980
They ran swiftly, and in a moment they were standing before Lu Bu.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:34.058
The battle began: the three brothers joined forces against Lu Bu, and the two sides fought neck and neck.

00:00:34.408 --> 00:00:38.056
Blade-light flashed and dust flew; the onlookers watched in amazement.

00:00:38.406 --> 00:00:41.406
Unable to hold them off, Lu Bu had no choice but to turn and flee.

00:00:41.756 --> 00:00:45.908
He rode farther and farther away, soon disappearing behind the pass gate.

00:00:46.258 --> 00:00:49.906
The three brothers defeated Lu Bu, and everyone remembered this battle.

00:00:50.256 --> 00:00:55.584
From then on, the names of the three heroes spread through camps everywhere.

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:59.654
The soldiers raised their arms and cheered loudly for the three heroes.

